      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787654826459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "doesn't give you a practical mathematical function like:\nHASH → password123\nInstead, if someone wants to discover the password, \nthey generally have to guess passwords and verify them.\nthis is why bcrypt called \"one-way\"",
      "fontSize": 33.051488189785935,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "doesn't give you a practical mathematical function like:\nHASH → password123\nInstead, if someone wants to discover the password, \nthey generally have to guess passwords and verify them.\nthis is why bcrypt called \"one-way\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iX65Pfa8sWY5IHrPvzBr0",
      "type": "text",
