      "seed": 1890920514,
      "version": 1067,
      "versionNonce": 1091471969,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787654826459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The user signing up;\nThe frontend sends an HTTP request to the backend.\n{\n    \"email\": \"mehdi@gmail.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}\n\nthe backend receive the password and does: \npassword\n    ↓\nbcrypt\n    ↓\nhashed password\n    ↓\ndatabase\n\nThen the user logs in:\nThe frontend sends:\n{\n    \"email\": \"mehdi@gmail.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}\n\nThe backend:\nFinds the user by email:\nGets the stored bcrypt hash $2b$12$...:\npassword123\n     +\nstored bcrypt hash\n     ↓\nbcrypt.verify()\n     ↓\nTrue",
      "fontSize": 37.76351372639622,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The user signing up;\nThe frontend sends an HTTP request to the backend.\n{\n    \"email\": \"mehdi@gmail.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}\n\nthe backend receive the password and does: \npassword\n    ↓\nbcrypt\n    ↓\nhashed password\n    ↓\ndatabase\n\nThen the user logs in:\nThe frontend sends:\n{\n    \"email\": \"mehdi@gmail.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}\n\nThe backend:\nFinds the user by email:\nGets the stored bcrypt hash $2b$12$...:\npassword123\n     +\nstored bcrypt hash\n     ↓\nbcrypt.verify()\n     ↓\nTrue",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "T_KkudC0Ee9Eu9DTdlmms",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3520.2474373211426,
      "y": 350.076716674497,
      "width": 1365.04052734375,
      "height": 2454.628392215754,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2sV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1603135262,
      "version": 1158,
      "versionNonce": 79595567,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787654826459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nNow the backend creates an access token:\nHEADER.PAYLOAD.SIGNATURE\nFor example:\nheader:\neyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9\n.\npayload:\neyJzdWIiOiIxMjMiLCJ1c2VybmFtZSI6Im1laGRpIiwicm9sZSI6InVzZXIifQ\n.\nsignature:\nabc123xyz456...\n\neach one of them claim data:\n\nFor example:\nheader:\n{\n    \"alg\": \"HS256\", # The JWT signature was created using the HS256 algorithm.\n    \"typ\": \"JWT\"      # This is a JWT.\n}\npayload:\n{\n    \"sub\": \"123\",\n    \"username\": \"mehdi\",\n    \"role\": \"user\",\n    \"exp\": 1780000900\n}\n\nthen encode header and  payload using Base64URL\n\nthen use them to make cryptographic result this is the SIGNATURE.\n\nJWT\n│\n├── Header\n│     │\n│     └── JSON\n│          ├── alg\n│          └── typ\n│\n├── Payload\n│     │\n│     └── JSON\n│          ├── sub\n│          ├── username\n│          ├── role\n│          └── exp\n│\n└── Signature\n      │\n      └── cryptographic value",
      "fontSize": 37.76351372639622,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nNow the backend creates an access token:\nHEADER.PAYLOAD.SIGNATURE\nFor example:\nheader:\neyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9\n.\npayload:\neyJzdWIiOiIxMjMiLCJ1c2VybmFtZSI6Im1laGRpIiwicm9sZSI6InVzZXIifQ\n.\nsignature:\nabc123xyz456...\n\neach one of them claim data:\n\nFor example:\nheader:\n{\n    \"alg\": \"HS256\", # The JWT signature was created using the HS256 algorithm.\n    \"typ\": \"JWT\"      # This is a JWT.\n}\npayload:\n{\n    \"sub\": \"123\",\n    \"username\": \"mehdi\",\n    \"role\": \"user\",\n    \"exp\": 1780000900\n}\n\nthen encode header and  payload using Base64URL\n\nthen use them to make cryptographic result this is the SIGNATURE.\n\nJWT\n│\n├── Header\n│     │\n│     └── JSON\n│          ├── alg\n│          └── typ\n│\n├── Payload\n│     │\n│     └── JSON\n│          ├── sub\n│          ├── username\n│          ├── role\n│          └── exp\n│\n└── Signature\n      │\n      └── cryptographic value",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Q_BzeZkLbO1zPZVzxwEG9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3510.6067956816023,
      "y": 2995.415507298774,
      "width": 1224.910888671875,
      "height": 802.4746666859196,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2sl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 385348515,
      "version": 1528,
      "versionNonce": 309368385,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787654826459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Then the backend creates an refresh token:\nthe server can put the refresh token into an HTTP-only cookie\n.\n                              SERVER\n                                     │\n         ┌─────────┴─────────┐\n         │                                                    │\n         ▼                                                  ▼\n      JSON body                          HTTP Cookie\n         │                                                    │\n         ▼                                                  ▼\n  access_token                          refresh_token\n\nThen the response might look like:\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\nContent-Type: application/json\nSet-Cookie: refresh_token=8f7c9a2e...; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Lax",
      "fontSize": 37.76351372639622,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Then the backend creates an refresh token:\nthe server can put the refresh token into an HTTP-only cookie\n.\n                              SERVER\n                                     │\n         ┌─────────┴─────────┐\n         │                                                    │\n         ▼                                                  ▼\n      JSON body                          HTTP Cookie\n         │                                                    │\n         ▼                                                  ▼\n  access_token                          refresh_token\n\nThen the response might look like:\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\nContent-Type: application/json\nSet-Cookie: refresh_token=8f7c9a2e...; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Lax",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IKa2PZ3j97iO1BRDKTl84",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4228.174217719701,
      "y": 3881.378373654112,
      "width": 857.1512451171875,
      "height": 1510.5405490558487,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2st",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1067231011,
      "version": 1806,
      "versionNonce": 2067507791,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787654826459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What does the access token do?\nThe access token is used to access protected APIs.\nSuppose the user wants:\nGET /profile\n\nThe frontend sends:\nGET /profile\nAuthorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...\n\nSo:\nFrontend\n     │\n     │ Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN\n    ▼\nFastAPI\n\nThe backend verifies the JWT:\nJWT\n │\n ├── Header\n ├── Payload\n └── Signature\n\nThen it can extract:\n{\n    \"sub\": \"123\"\n}\n\nand know:\nuser_id = 123\n\nThen the request is allowed.",
      "fontSize": 37.76351372639622,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What does the access token do?\nThe access token is used to access protected APIs.\nSuppose the user wants:\nGET /profile\n\nThe frontend sends:\nGET /profile\nAuthorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...\n\nSo:\nFrontend\n     │\n     │ Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN\n    ▼\nFastAPI\n\nThe backend verifies the JWT:\nJWT\n │\n ├── Header\n ├── Payload\n └── Signature\n\nThen it can extract:\n{\n    \"sub\": \"123\"\n}\n\nand know:\nuser_id = 123\n\nThen the request is allowed.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2iI2zSJZsF7EkNfWoVK1z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3224.2420153728904,
      "y": 3865.1502197064956,
      "width": 1481.4227294921875,
      "height": 94.40878431599054,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2sx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1103026829,
      "version": 1865,
      "versionNonce": 661005857,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787654826459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why do we need a refresh token?\nused exclusively to obtain new access tokens without requiring the user to log in again.",
      "fontSize": 37.76351372639622,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why do we need a refresh token?\nused exclusively to obtain new access tokens without requiring the user to log in again.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qQ0NwA1_GCQXIl-F9rQzL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1805.2459909217769,
      "y": 1065.7903860545075,
      "width": 735.1452668099995,
      "height": 1410.8958849692294,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 134287490,
      "version": 1501,
      "versionNonce": 101681263,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787654826459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "                             USER IS LOGGED IN\n                                              │\n             ┌───────────┴───────────┐\n             │                                                               │\n             ▼                                                             ▼\n       Access Token                                  Refresh Token\n             │                                                               │\n             │                                                               │\n       API requests                                      used only to\n             │                                                     get a new\n             │                                                    access token\n             ▼                                                             │\n       Authorization                                               │\n       Bearer JWT                                                  │\n             │                                                              │\n             ▼                                                            │\n          FastAPI                                                      │\n             │                                                              │\n       verify JWT                                                    │\n             │                                                              │\n             ▼                                                            │\n          allow request                                           │\n             |-------------------------------------- |           \n                               access token expires\n                                            │\n                                           ▼\n                                 /auth/refresh\n                                            │\n                                           ▼\n                              verify refresh token\n                                            │\n                                           ▼\n                               create new JWT\n                                           │\n                                          ▼\n                                  return JSON",
      "fontSize": 31.353241888205098,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "                             USER IS LOGGED IN\n                                              │\n             ┌───────────┴───────────┐\n             │                                                               │\n             ▼                                                             ▼\n       Access Token                                  Refresh Token\n             │                                                               │\n             │                                                               │\n       API requests                                      used only to\n             │                                                     get a new\n             │                                                    access token\n             ▼                                                             │\n       Authorization                                               │\n       Bearer JWT                                                  │\n             │                                                              │\n             ▼                                                            │\n          FastAPI                                                      │\n             │                                                              │\n       verify JWT                                                    │\n             │                                                              │\n             ▼                                                            │\n          allow request                                           │\n             |-------------------------------------- |                                                        \n                               access token expires\n                                            │\n                                           ▼\n                                 /auth/refresh\n                                            │\n                                           ▼\n                              verify refresh token\n                                            │\n                                           ▼\n                               create new JWT\n                                           │\n                                          ▼\n                                  return JSON",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
