      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Category        Module        Type        Points        Status\nWeb        Frontend + backend framework        Major        2        Backend done, frontend pending\nWeb        Real-time features (WebSockets)        Major        2        Not started (backend)\nWeb        Public API, secured + documented        Major        2        8 endpoints exist, needs API key + rate limiting\nWeb        ORM        Minor        1        ✅ Done (SQLAlchemy)\nUser Management        Advanced permissions / roles        Major        2        Not started\nUser Management        2FA        Minor        1        Not started\nUser Management        OAuth login        Minor        1        Not started\nData & Analytics        Advanced analytics dashboard        Major        2        Not started\nData & Analytics        GDPR compliance        Minor        1        Not started\nAI        LLM-powered assistant        Major        2        Not started",
